==Requirements==
Player must have an active [[Membership]] in order to do [[Quest:Horrible Hiccups]]
==To Start==
Speak with [[Slinky]] located at the [[Seaside]] [[Luxurious Oceanfront Homes]].
==Goals==
Slinky in Seaside has turned you into a monster to better scare the hiccups out of Cutes. Talk to him again if it wears off.
*Scare Cutes Dozen to cure her of the hiccups
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Slinky]] located at the [[Seaside]] [[Luxurious Oceanfront Homes]].
#*"Have you seen Cutes today? She's got a really bad case of the hiccups! Poor girl... we have to help her!<br />Now, I'm no expert, but I believe that the only way to <font color='#d9781a'>cure hiccups</font> is to give the hiccup-er a real scare! I have just the thing too!<br /><font color='#d9781a'>Find Cutes Dozen</font>, and scare those hiccups right out of her!" -Slinky
#Scare Cutes Dozen to cure her of the hiccups
#*Speak with [[Cutes Dozen]] located at the [[Seaside]] [[Luxurious Oceanfront Homes]] while under [[Slinky's Illusion]] that lasts 30 seconds.
#**If the illusion expires players may speak with [[Slinky]] to try again.
#**Tip: Use a [[pet]] with a speed boost.
#*"Ahhhhhhh!<br />Wait...you're not a monster!<br />Hiccups? I don't even have the hiccups!<br />Slinky sent you? That meanie! Why is he always trying to scare me?" -Cutes Dozen
